@startuml
[*] --> List Displayed

List Displayed : Displaying order list

List Displayed --> Item Selected : Click item
List Displayed --> Reordering : Click Reorder

Item Selected : Single item selected

Item Selected --> Multiple Items Selected : Click another item
Item Selected --> Reordering : Click Reorder

Multiple Items Selected : Multiple items selected

Multiple Items Selected --> Reordering : Click Reorder

Reordering : Reordering items

Reordering --> List Updated : Reorder completed

List Updated : Updated order list displayed
List Updated --> [*]

@enduml
